TEXT_SETTINGS_CONTEXT_MENU_TITLE        = Context menu
TEXT_SETTINGS_CTX_NOTE                  = Menu entries are static registry verbs and need no administrator rights; on Windows 11 they live under "Show more options".
TEXT_SETTINGS_CTX_EXTRACT_RULES         = Extract looks at what the archive holds: a lone file comes out as-is; everything under one top-level folder releases that whole folder without wrapping it in a second copy of itself; anything else goes into a new folder named after the archive, using "name (2)", "name (3)" when that name is taken. "Extract and delete" uses the same rules and removes the archive once the extraction succeeded, volumes included.
